    "Stars, the tag and colour labels are also written into each photo as XMP, so Lightroom, Bridge, digiKam and other apps see them. Camera RAW files and formats minivu can’t rewrite get an XMP sidecar beside them instead. Ratings from those apps always show in minivu, for photos you haven’t rated here." : {

