    "Text size" : {

    },
    "The application is no longer where it was added." : {

    },
    "The embedded preview is the JPEG the camera saved with the photo. It shows at once; where it is too small for the screen or the zoom, the RAW data is rendered instead. Extended dynamic range always renders the RAW data, which takes a moment per photo, and its highlights need an HDR screen." : {

    },
    "The first editor opens with ⌘E. The images open as saved; when the editor saves one, minivu shows the change." : {

    },
    "The gallery is a folder with index.html, a page for each picture and a style sheet. It needs nothing from the internet, and opens from disk in any browser." : {

    },
    "The image stays at full size; the anchor is where it sits on the new canvas." : {

    },
    "The longest side in pixels. Leave empty to keep the size; smaller images are never enlarged." : {

    },
    "The preset keeps %@. Saving under a name already used replaces that preset." : {

    },
    "The source follows the brush at the same distance for every stroke." : {

    },
    "The video plays as a slideshow would: the first picture fades in from black and the last fades out. HDR photos are shown as on a standard display. Transitions play as chosen, even with Reduce Motion on." : {

    },
